  "content_en": "The concubine's plan to marry the best princess, Zhen, once again attacked, making Jiang's face embarrassing and ugly. I wanted to compete with her, firstly because I was afraid that the old lady would be unhappy, and secondly because I didn’t have the kind of down-and-out personality she had. But ignore her? This man also bullied her too much. He repeatedly provoked her and vowed to squeeze her, a soft persimmon, into vomiting blood? \"Fourth Aunt, actually...actually it's none of Ten Sister's business tonight. It's me...I was the one who greedily drank mother's tea, ran to the toilet twice, and asked grandma to punish Xiaojiu. Don't blame mother!\" Just when Mr. Jiang was angrily struggling, suddenly Wenjiu stood up. Everyone couldn't help but be startled. The tenth sister was so ashamed and guilty that she could hardly sit still. The next moment she seemed to rush up and pull the ninth sister up. \"Okay, okay, Jiu Yatou, get up quickly. Who wants to blame you? Is such a small thing worth it?\" The old lady glanced at Jiu Yatou, who was kneeling in front of her, and waved her hand. Cuifeng went to help Ninth Sister, and Ninth Sister took advantage of the opportunity to stand up. He secretly glanced at Jiang on the side. When he caught the hint of darkness that flashed across that dignified and beautiful face in time, he couldn't help but shake his head secretly in his heart. Fortunately, her purpose was not here... \"Thank you, grandma!\" Ninth Sister stepped aside again, but when she passed by Tenth Sister, she suddenly extended seven fingers to her. The tenth sister was startled, then understood, then turned her head and asked the eleventh sister in a low voice, \"By the way, the eleventh sister, why don't you see the seventh sister in your courtyard? Could it be that she has also fallen asleep and returned to her cage?\" As soon as the tenth sister Wen said this, the others did not show it, but the Zhen family couldn't help but froze for a moment. \"Tenth sister, how could the seventh sister go back to sleep? She got up early, but she didn't go with my mother and me. Instead, she went to the third sister's place...\" But the eleventh sister Wen, who finally got the opportunity to speak, still explained in a coquettish way. At this moment, it was Zhen's turn to turn blue. It is not a secret in the Wen family that the smart and beautiful concubine Wen Qijie despises her aunt, Zhen. Sister Wen Qi's biological mother, Aunt Deng, was once the maid beside the old lady, and she was quite decent in front of the old lady. This Mrs. Zhen really hated and annoyed her as a concubine, but she was helpless... Mrs. Jiang glanced at Mrs. Zhen, who had a constipated look on her face, and then at the two daughters who were secretly winking at each other. She quickly picked up the tea cup and sipped the tea to hide the smile on her face. Sister Jiu had of course noticed Jiang's expression and couldn't help but shake her head again in her heart. Her aunt has always been suspicious and worried. If she just took care of what happened in the morning, she might not be fine. Act cleverly and steal the show! Due to her temperament, Jiang will definitely place such a position in her heart for what she does. So she kept her back up... The situation now became that the sisters joined forces to fight against the enemy in order to protect their mother. When Mrs. Jiang saw Mrs. Zhen being defeated, she was happy and relieved. I am happy because I have given a powerful counterattack to those who are ostracizing me. I am gratified that the people who stand up for me are my two daughters who are not yet in their prime. Of course, haha, the effect is not just that - \"You talk too much, shut up.\" Mrs. Zhen began to reprimand her daughter bitterly. Sister Eleven lowered her head with an aggrieved look on her face, not daring to speak any more. \"Fourth family member, why are you shouting at a child? If you want to show this to your child, you must know that words are never as good as teaching by example.\" At this time, the old lady who had been watching all this with a cold eye suddenly said in a stern tone. Having been scolded twice in the morning by her mother-in-law and mother-in-law, Rao Zhen did not dare to do it again, no matter how strong the iron wall was, and lowered her head in fear. \"Family and family make everything prosperous. As the mistress of the family, she must be virtuous, generous, and elegant. She cannot be like a market woman, making trouble all day long. Otherwise, how can you control the children's hearts and make them obey you? If the children don't obey you, how can you teach them well...\" But the old lady did not let the matter go. Instead, she continued to lecture Mrs. Zhen coldly. It seemed that Mrs. Zhen had really annoyed her. Everyone in the room lowered their heads quietly, and Mrs. Zhen even responded with two tears in her eyes. \"Hey, I'm a big boss now, so I won't say any more. You can think more about it yourself!\" After the old lady spoke at length, she finally concluded with this sentence. However, it was already bright outside at this time, and the early morning sunlight came in through the red-painted window lattice, making the room bright. \"From the second child's house, why don't you take the time to visit Wu Yatou? She's been ill for a long time.It's not a good idea to go away, it will be troublesome if the root cause of the disease is found. \"Just when everyone thought they could finally breathe a sigh of relief, the old lady suddenly looked at the second lady aside. \"Yes! \"The second lady was startled, and then quickly lowered her head in response. However, the moment she lowered her head, she couldn't help but have red circles in her eyes. After hearing these words, Mrs. Zhen, who was lying on the ground as if admitting her mistake, was shocked, and her eyes slipped towards Mrs. Jiang for some reason. Mrs. Jiang still looked at her nose and mouth, but he was just next to her. Sister Ninth, who was sitting in the back, could see it clearly. After hearing what the old lady said to the second wife, Mrs. Jiang's hand holding the tea cup couldn't help but trembled because of excitement! Sister Ninth couldn't help but curl up her lips in her heart. The proud and proud Fifth Sister Wen had a quarrel with her aunt Miao a few days ago. After selling off the two girls around her, the fifth sister began to stay home due to illness. Now the old lady started to intervene and asked Miao to take care of the fifth sister's illness. It was obvious that she was not satisfied with Miao. This Miao had always been the most favored lady in front of the old lady. Even her husband had inherited the title and had been in charge of the eldest wife. Not even Zou. How could Mrs. Jiang not be excited? This old lady was actually praising her for her right conduct and the peace in her room... As she was thinking, she suddenly received Jiang's look. She lowered her eyebrows more cautiously and acted respectfully and innocently. \"The old lady, after being silent for a long time, suddenly sighed again. \"Haha...Old lady, what are you feeling about? \"But at this moment, the door curtain was opened again, and a woman wearing a crimson jacket embroidered with brocade and five-color makeup and a crow-blue heddle skirt embroidered with moon and white plum blossoms led a large group of people in. She smiled before saying anything, and she was fair and wealthy. She was none other than the eldest lady Zou... --------- Off topic - Dear friends,",
